Zero Inspector Kit 集成步骤（基于 v1.3.2，最新版以 pub.dev 为准）：

1. 添加依赖：
   dependencies:
     zero_inspector_kit: ^1.3.2
   或在项目根目录执行：flutter pub add zero_inspector_kit

2. 安装：flutter pub get

3. 初始化（零侵入，推荐一行式）：
   import 'package:zero_inspector_kit/zero_inspector_kit.dart';
   void main() {
     ZeroInspectorKit.runAppWithInspector(const MyApp());
   }
   如需更多控制，可用两行式：
   void main() {
     ZeroInspectorKit.init();
     runApp(ZeroInspectorKit.wrapApp(const MyApp()));
   }

4. 路由跟踪（可选）：在 MaterialApp 中加 navigatorObservers: [InspectorRouteObserver()]。

集成后，调试悬浮按钮会自动通过 Overlay 显示（可拖拽停靠）；自动捕获 print()/错误、拦截 http 与 Dio 请求、扫描 SQLite 数据库。Release 模式下会自动禁用，无需手动移除代码。
完整文档：https://pub.dev/packages/zero_inspector_kit

How to integrate Zero Inspector Kit (based on v1.3.2; check pub.dev for the latest):

1. Add the dependency:
   dependencies:
     zero_inspector_kit: ^1.3.2
   Or run in your project root: flutter pub add zero_inspector_kit

2. Install: flutter pub get

3. Initialize (zero-intrusion, recommended one-liner):
   import 'package:zero_inspector_kit/zero_inspector_kit.dart';
   void main() {
     ZeroInspectorKit.runAppWithInspector(const MyApp());
   }
   For more control, use the two-line form:
   void main() {
     ZeroInspectorKit.init();
     runApp(ZeroInspectorKit.wrapApp(const MyApp()));
   }

4. Route tracking (optional): add navigatorObservers: [InspectorRouteObserver()] to your MaterialApp.

After integration, a draggable floating button shows up via Overlay automatically; it captures print()/errors, intercepts http and Dio requests, and scans SQLite databases. It auto-disables in Release mode, so you don't need to remove the code. Full docs: https://pub.dev/packages/zero_inspector_kit
